TY  - JOUR
TI  - Test-Time Training with Masked Autoencoders
AU  - Yossi Gandelsman
AU  - Yu Sun
AU  - Xinlei Chen
AU  - Alexei Efros
PY  - 2022
AB  - Test-time training adapts to a new test distribution on the fly by optimizing a model for each test input using self-supervision.In this paper, we use masked autoencoders for this one-sample learning problem.Empirically, our simple method improves generalization on many visual benchmarks for distribution shifts.Theoretically, we characterize this improvement in terms of the bias-variance trade-off.
UR  - https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/2022/hash/bcdec1c2d60f94a93b6e36f937aa0530-Abstract-Conference.html
